// 应用内模态对话框：删除确认、操作结果说明。覆盖整个窗口，打开时抢走键盘焦点，关闭后由 Rust 把焦点还给活动面板。
// - 有取消按钮时 Esc = 取消；只有“知道了”时 Esc 与 Enter 都 = 确定。
// - danger（永久删除）时 Enter 不触发确定，必须点击按钮，避免误按；默认动作永远是更安全的取消。
// 标识：对话框 groupbox “对话框”，按钮的 accessible-label 即按钮文字。
import { Theme } from "theme.slint";

component DialogButton inherits Rectangle {
    in property <string> text;
    in property <bool> primary: false;
    in property <bool> danger: false;
    callback clicked();

    height: Theme.control-h;
    width: max(84px * Theme.text-scale, label.preferred-width + 28px);
    border-radius: 6px;
    border-width: root.primary ? 0px : 1px;
    border-color: Theme.divider-strong;
    background: root.primary ? (root.danger ? (ta.pressed ? #a3331f : ta.has-hover ? #b53a29 : Theme.danger) : (ta.pressed ? #2559b8 : ta.has-hover ? #2a64cf : Theme.accent)) : (ta.pressed ? Theme.pressed : ta.has-hover ? Theme.hover-soft : Theme.surface);
    accessible-role: button;
    accessible-label: root.text;
    accessible-action-default => {
        root.clicked();
    }

    label := Text {
        text: root.text;
        color: root.primary ? #ffffff : Theme.text;
        font-size: Theme.font;
        font-weight: root.primary ? 600 : 400;
        horizontal-alignment: center;
        vertical-alignment: center;
    }

    ta := TouchArea {
        clicked => {
            root.clicked();
        }
    }
}

export component ModalDialog inherits Rectangle {
    in property <string> title;
    in property <string> body;
    in property <string> confirm-label;
    // 为空时不显示取消按钮（仅提示）
    in property <string> cancel-label;
    in property <bool> danger;
    // 每次打开（含从一个对话框直接换成另一个、实例被复用时）加一，让键盘焦点回到对话框
    in property <int> focus-token;
    callback accepted();
    callback cancelled();

    changed focus-token => {
        scope.focus();
    }

    background: #1f232933;
    accessible-role: groupbox;
    accessible-label: "对话框";
    accessible-description: root.title;

    // 吞掉对话框外的鼠标操作
    TouchArea { }

    scope := FocusScope {
        init => {
            self.focus();
        }
        key-pressed(e) => {
            if (e.text == Key.Escape) {
                if (root.cancel-label != "") {
                    root.cancelled();
                } else {
                    root.accepted();
                }
                return accept;
            }
            if (e.text == Key.Return && !root.danger) {
                root.accepted();
                return accept;
            }
            // 其余按键一律吞掉，不让它们落到下面的界面
            accept
        }

        card := Rectangle {
            x: (parent.width - self.width) / 2;
            y: max(24px, (parent.height - self.height) / 3);
            width: min(parent.width - 48px, 460px * Theme.text-scale);
            height: content.preferred-height + 44px;
            background: Theme.surface;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-width: 1px;
            border-color: Theme.divider;
            drop-shadow-blur: 24px;
            drop-shadow-offset-y: 6px;
            drop-shadow-color: #00000033;

            content := VerticalLayout {
                padding: 22px;
                spacing: 12px;

                Text {
                    text: root.title;
                    color: root.danger ? Theme.danger : Theme.text;
                    font-size: Theme.font-heading;
                    font-weight: 600;
                    wrap: word-wrap;
                    accessible-role: text;
                    accessible-label: "对话框标题";
                    accessible-value: root.title;
                }

                Text {
                    text: root.body;
                    color: Theme.text-secondary;
                    font-size: Theme.font;
                    wrap: word-wrap;
                    accessible-role: text;
                    accessible-label: "对话框内容";
                    accessible-value: root.body;
                }

                HorizontalLayout {
                    alignment: end;
                    spacing: 10px;
                    padding-top: 8px;

                    if root.cancel-label != "": DialogButton {
                        text: root.cancel-label;
                        clicked => {
                            root.cancelled();
                        }
                    }

                    DialogButton {
                        text: root.confirm-label;
                        primary: true;
                        danger: root.danger;
                        clicked => {
                            root.accepted();
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
